# AgentInterdict License

AgentInterdict is distributed under a **dual license**:

## Community (Free)

The Community edition is free to use for personal and non-commercial purposes.
You may download, run, and modify it for your own use.

## Commercial (Pro / Business / Enterprise)

Commercial use — including any use by an organisation, or any use that unlocks
the paid remote features (updated threat feed, hosted classifiers, policy packs,
compliance packs, CVE advisory feed, anomaly detection, remote audit) — requires
a paid subscription to the relevant tier.

### Key terms

- The **source code** in this repository is freely available to download and inspect.
- **Paid features are remotely controlled** and served from the AgentInterdict control
  plane. They are gated by a signed licence lease and are not part of the free build.
- You may **not** redistribute the paid remote features, bypass the licence
  verification, or resell the software without a commercial agreement.
- AgentInterdict is provided **"as is"** without warranty of any kind. See the
  security claim in the README: it reduces and contains persistent-memory risk
  but does not make prompt injection impossible.

For commercial licensing, enterprise agreements, or redistribution rights, contact
the AgentInterdict team.

